flowchart TB
 Browser[HTML CSS JavaScript] --> Front[public/index.php Router]
 Front --> Guards[CSRF RateLimiter AuthMiddleware RoleMiddleware]
 Guards --> Controller[Controllers]
 Controller --> View[resources/views]
 Controller --> Service[Services / Models / Repositories]
 Service --> PDO[PDO native prepared statements]
 PDO --> DB[(MariaDB - 24 tables)]
 Service --> Queue[mail_outbox encrypted queue]
 Worker[bin/process-mail.php] --> Queue
 Queue --> PHPMailer[PHPMailer]
 PHPMailer --> SMTP[Configured SMTP server]
